(3438677, 480291, 70369, '<td valign="top">Hey, I have those cards.. They suck while playing (too hard to hold &amp; slippery) but they sure are fun to look at. Great idea for the challenge &amp; it''s interesting to me that you chose to keep the ace out above the rest. I also see a tad bit of noise on this &amp; if you ran it through neat image, I think it would have given it a very clear finish. 6 for me. :-)</td>', 'Hey, I have those cards.. They suck while playing (too hard to hold & slippery) but they sure are fun to look at. Great idea for the challenge & it''s interesting to me that you chose to keep the ace out above the rest. I also see a tad bit of noise on this & if you ran it through neat image, I think it would have given it a very clear finish. 6 for me. :-)', '2007-03-07 14:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3438686, 479084, 70369, '<td valign="top">cooooool.. Great idea, love the angle you shot this at.. It gives the background an appearance of squares &amp; the foreground one of diamonds. I love your choice of black &amp; white against the red, it really gives a pop. The tomato''s seem just a tad out of focus, but, after looking at it closer, they aren''t. Must be the effect of the pattern. 10 for me.</td>', 'cooooool.. Great idea, love the angle you shot this at.. It gives the background an appearance of squares & the foreground one of diamonds. I love your choice of black & white against the red, it really gives a pop. The tomato''s seem just a tad out of focus, but, after looking at it closer, they aren''t. Must be the effect of the pattern. 10 for me.', '2007-03-07 14:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3438693, 480264, 70369, '<td valign="top">The focus is just a little too soft for me &amp; the background has some dark blotches that are a little distracting. imho :-). Great idea &amp; maybe with some different lighting, it would have worked better for me.</td>', 'The focus is just a little too soft for me & the background has some dark blotches that are a little distracting. imho :-). Great idea & maybe with some different lighting, it would have worked better for me.', '2007-03-07 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3438707, 480181, 70369, '<td valign="top">hmm, I know this is probably very red in real life, but it''s coming accross as very orange. I think the lighting in there is affecting this &amp; maybe a different white balance would have gotten a totally different effect. The bottom left corner, which is really dark I think captures the actual color. Great pattern &amp; texture and I really like the angle you chose. 8 for me.</td>', 'hmm, I know this is probably very red in real life, but it''s coming accross as very orange. I think the lighting in there is affecting this & maybe a different white balance would have gotten a totally different effect. The bottom left corner, which is really dark I think captures the actual color. Great pattern & texture and I really like the angle you chose. 8 for me.', '2007-03-07 14:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3438719, 479344, 70369, '<td valign="top">What a great place to get your "red challenge" shot. I think if you had a tighter crop on this image, it would have made it more appealing. There''s a lot of negative space and I''m not sure if it adds anything to the picture as a whole.</td>', 'What a great place to get your "red challenge" shot. I think if you had a tighter crop on this image, it would have made it more appealing. There''s a lot of negative space and I''m not sure if it adds anything to the picture as a whole.', '2007-03-07 14:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
