(3439331, 480485, 73575, '<td valign="top">This is actually the only photo in this challenge that grabbed my attention enough to vote on it. Love the subject and idea, but the composition is a little lacking... the hat is centered vertically and sort of in-between center and 1/3 right, which isn''t very pleasing. I would like to zoom out a little and place the hat one hook right, then align the picture in 1/3''s; maybe have the hat hat 1/3 down and 1/3 from right, door&amp;wall cover left 1/3.</td>', 'This is actually the only photo in this challenge that grabbed my attention enough to vote on it. Love the subject and idea, but the composition is a little lacking... the hat is centered vertically and sort of in-between center and 1/3 right, which isn''t very pleasing. I would like to zoom out a little and place the hat one hook right, then align the picture in 1/3''s; maybe have the hat hat 1/3 down and 1/3 from right, door&wall cover left 1/3.', '2007-03-07 16:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
