(3439633, 480176, 72439, '<td valign="top">I like it quite a bit but I find the lights could have been better controlled. the reflections in the glass are too bright and easy to identify so it spoils the mood a little</td>', 'I like it quite a bit but I find the lights could have been better controlled. the reflections in the glass are too bright and easy to identify so it spoils the mood a little', '2007-03-07 17:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3439635, 479148, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors in this shot. Composition is a little lacking. There isn''t anything on the right side to help balance the red object. (What is it by the way?). As such the object drags the eye to the left part of the frame.<br/> <br/>The bold contrast is a good idea but the picture does seem to be a bit dark.<br/> <br/>Interesting approach to the challenge. The abstract nature of the object creates visual appeal.</td>', 'Nice bold colors in this shot. Composition is a little lacking. There isn''t anything on the right side to help balance the red object. (What is it by the way?). As such the object drags the eye to the left part of the frame. The bold contrast is a good idea but the picture does seem to be a bit dark. Interesting approach to the challenge. The abstract nature of the object creates visual appeal.', '2007-03-07 17:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3439636, 480319, 71392, '<td valign="top">orangy</td>', 'orangy', '2007-03-07 17:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3439648, 480262, 72439, '<td valign="top">I think additional fill from the left would have strengthened this image</td>', 'I think additional fill from the left would have strengthened this image', '2007-03-07 17:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3439664, 480518, 66515, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the central blossom is quite nice. It captures a lot of good detail and creates good foreground interest. The depth of field applied to the overall picture works and help create three dimensional space. <br/> <br/>The background color is a little distracting. Perhaps a slightly darker shade of red would help. <br/> <br/>The border is a little thick and detracts from the image. The rose hip on the right side is kind of "stuck" into the frame. It would be nice to have a bit of separation. <br/> <br/>While there are many roses shown in this challenge this one takes a unique approach with the dried blossoms.</td>', 'The sharpness of the central blossom is quite nice. It captures a lot of good detail and creates good foreground interest. The depth of field applied to the overall picture works and help create three dimensional space.  The background color is a little distracting. Perhaps a slightly darker shade of red would help.  The border is a little thick and detracts from the image. The rose hip on the right side is kind of "stuck" into the frame. It would be nice to have a bit of separation.  While there are many roses shown in this challenge this one takes a unique approach with the dried blossoms.', '2007-03-07 17:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3439665, 478698, 23016, '<td valign="top">Few degrees tilted counterclockwise. The background is not so nice: not so white, a bit creased... Try working with different lightning, don''t be pleased with the only one ceiling lamp I can see on the reflection!</td>', 'Few degrees tilted counterclockwise. The background is not so nice: not so white, a bit creased... Try working with different lightning, don''t be pleased with the only one ceiling lamp I can see on the reflection!', '2007-03-07 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
