(3439679, 479721, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Excellent portrait.  A few wrinkles visible in the background and I bet a few voters will say the dog isn''t red.   Wrong they would be and I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Back to comment: Excellent portrait.  A few wrinkles visible in the background and I bet a few voters will say the dog isn''t red.   Wrong they would be and I gave you a 7.', '2007-03-07 17:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
