(3439701, 480264, 23016, '<td valign="top">I like the soft touch in this photo but I''d like to see more detail on the water drop.. Nice composition! good work!</td>', 'I like the soft touch in this photo but I''d like to see more detail on the water drop.. Nice composition! good work!', '2007-03-07 17:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
