(3439766, 477645, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  You choose a tough subject to photograph for this challenge.  The flame looks a bit over exposed and the post processing makes the dark areas of the background look like they were spray painted.  I would also suggest you read up on the rule of thirds, as the centering of the flame in the image is one of  the least interesting locations you could have put it.</td>', 'Back to comment:  You choose a tough subject to photograph for this challenge.  The flame looks a bit over exposed and the post processing makes the dark areas of the background look like they were spray painted.  I would also suggest you read up on the rule of thirds, as the centering of the flame in the image is one of  the least interesting locations you could have put it.', '2007-03-07 17:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
