(3439869, 479543, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like how the cards fan further apart on a diagonal from the top left to the bottom right.  I wish the queen was the only face card and it was the only diamond suit.  Good DOF.  Very hard to achieve on a slant like this.  It was hard choosing between the three suggested numbers.  But luv always wins out.</td>', 'I like how the cards fan further apart on a diagonal from the top left to the bottom right.  I wish the queen was the only face card and it was the only diamond suit.  Good DOF.  Very hard to achieve on a slant like this.  It was hard choosing between the three suggested numbers.  But luv always wins out.', '2007-03-07 18:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
