(3440077, 480005, 72439, '<td valign="top">I''m liking the composition but unfortunately it has some blur. if you managed this handheld at night congrats but a tripod would have been ideal.<br/>also JPG artifacting is clearly visible around the door seam, the wheel well, and most obviously the vent...  with such large field of a single color you must be well under the 150kb file size limit so turning down the jpg compression until the image just squeezes under the file size limit would take care of those completely.</td>', 'I''m liking the composition but unfortunately it has some blur. if you managed this handheld at night congrats but a tripod would have been ideal.also JPG artifacting is clearly visible around the door seam, the wheel well, and most obviously the vent...  with such large field of a single color you must be well under the 150kb file size limit so turning down the jpg compression until the image just squeezes under the file size limit would take care of those completely.', '2007-03-07 19:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
