(3440137, 477472, 65234, '<td valign="top">There is a certain lack of redness to this, which I shall assume is intentional for the benefit of the red-green colorblind amongst us, judging by your title.  Still, going beyond the color, I find a lack of detail here which does not engage me as a viewer.  The lighting is also rather flat.</td>', 'There is a certain lack of redness to this, which I shall assume is intentional for the benefit of the red-green colorblind amongst us, judging by your title.  Still, going beyond the color, I find a lack of detail here which does not engage me as a viewer.  The lighting is also rather flat.', '2007-03-07 19:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
