(3440474, 478545, 72439, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing from the moire pattern in the image that you took a picture of a monitor.  selecting a shutter speed that is an even multiple of the refresh rate helps avoid those issues. for tv signals standard ntsc is 60hz and pal is 50hz</td>', 'I''m guessing from the moire pattern in the image that you took a picture of a monitor.  selecting a shutter speed that is an even multiple of the refresh rate helps avoid those issues. for tv signals standard ntsc is 60hz and pal is 50hz', '2007-03-07 20:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
