(3440486, 480542, 72439, '<td valign="top">really great subject.  I see some sharpening halos around the high contrast areas so it was probably a little too much.</td>', 'really great subject.  I see some sharpening halos around the high contrast areas so it was probably a little too much.', '2007-03-07 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440487, 478004, 66515, '<td valign="top">The highlights are blown out here. I can''t see any details in the foreground. The chipmunk in the left tree is cute but I wonder why you cropped his tail. Your horizon is also quite skewed. <br/> <br/>That aside this is also quite blurry. I would recommend using a tripod and/or turning up the ISO and using a faster shutterspeed. <br/> <br/>This certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'The highlights are blown out here. I can''t see any details in the foreground. The chipmunk in the left tree is cute but I wonder why you cropped his tail. Your horizon is also quite skewed.  That aside this is also quite blurry. I would recommend using a tripod and/or turning up the ISO and using a faster shutterspeed.  This certainly meets the challenge.', '2007-03-07 20:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440491, 479559, 72439, '<td valign="top">I wish I could pan like that.  really nice work.</td>', 'I wish I could pan like that.  really nice work.', '2007-03-07 20:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440498, 479117, 72439, '<td valign="top">you missed a spot ;)</td>', 'you missed a spot ;)', '2007-03-07 20:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440502, 480190, 66515, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this shot. The clouds (jet streams?) add interest to the sky and create leading lines that take your eye across the picture.  The composition works for me and I like the overall curve of the tree line. <br/> <br/>This would work better with greater sharpnesss in the trees. Their edges are a little soft so the silhouette effect isn''t as strong as it could be. <br/> <br/>The trees around the sun are also a little hot. Not much you can do under basic but I thought I would mention it. <br/> <br/>Definitely worthy of this challenge and is a fresh take on the challenge. It makes a bold statement</td>', 'I really like the concept of this shot. The clouds (jet streams?) add interest to the sky and create leading lines that take your eye across the picture.  The composition works for me and I like the overall curve of the tree line.  This would work better with greater sharpnesss in the trees. Their edges are a little soft so the silhouette effect isn''t as strong as it could be.  The trees around the sun are also a little hot. Not much you can do under basic but I thought I would mention it.  Definitely worthy of this challenge and is a fresh take on the challenge. It makes a bold statement', '2007-03-07 20:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440520, 478318, 72439, '<td valign="top">a little softer focus would have worked. <br/>a wide brimmed red hat covering the entire face save the lips would have been more striking</td>', 'a little softer focus would have worked. a wide brimmed red hat covering the entire face save the lips would have been more striking', '2007-03-07 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440525, 479868, 66515, '<td valign="top">A simple subject and an interesting idea. The colors of the subject are rich and nicely saturated. <br/> <br/>The composition is a bit dull. Getting lower would help for starters. Moving the hydrant off center would also help. Get a bit closer to give the subject more prominence in the shot or try getting away from the hydrant and relying its color to bring the eye to it. <br/> <br/>The background of the picture is distracting. Using a larger aperture would allow you to blur out the background. <br/> <br/>This hits the nail on the head for meeting the challenge.</td>', 'A simple subject and an interesting idea. The colors of the subject are rich and nicely saturated.  The composition is a bit dull. Getting lower would help for starters. Moving the hydrant off center would also help. Get a bit closer to give the subject more prominence in the shot or try getting away from the hydrant and relying its color to bring the eye to it.  The background of the picture is distracting. Using a larger aperture would allow you to blur out the background.  This hits the nail on the head for meeting the challenge.', '2007-03-07 20:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440529, 478513, 59442, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2007-03-07 20:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
