(3440818, 480019, 70375, '<td valign="top">I see this one coming in at a very good place :) Really really really unique idea and perfect execution. Reds are bright and crispy, photograph is noise free, and the expressions given to the inanimate objects are perfect :) All I have to say is GOOD LUCK AND GREAT JOB!! NVJC.</td>', 'I see this one coming in at a very good place :) Really really really unique idea and perfect execution. Reds are bright and crispy, photograph is noise free, and the expressions given to the inanimate objects are perfect :) All I have to say is GOOD LUCK AND GREAT JOB!! NVJC.', '2007-03-07 22:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440822, 477783, 51623, '<td valign="top">nicely done...nice job really getting the detail of the different parts of the flower.</td>', 'nicely done...nice job really getting the detail of the different parts of the flower.', '2007-03-07 22:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440828, 479934, 51623, '<td valign="top">great use of your aperture to create the blur.<br/>beautiful shot.</td>', 'great use of your aperture to create the blur.beautiful shot.', '2007-03-07 22:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440832, 480496, 51623, '<td valign="top">the glow and warm feel of this photo are greatly captured.  <br/> <br/>well done.</td>', 'the glow and warm feel of this photo are greatly captured.   well done.', '2007-03-07 22:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440839, 479837, 70375, '<td valign="top">Great REDness! I love how they seem used and abused. Interruptions of black rectangles and gray circles make this picture easy to look at and fun to contemplate. :) Suggestions on making it better: Have the keyholes all facing the same way? I don''t know if that would add to or take away though... hmmm tough to say really. Anyway, good luck and great shot! :) NVJC.</td>', 'Great REDness! I love how they seem used and abused. Interruptions of black rectangles and gray circles make this picture easy to look at and fun to contemplate. :) Suggestions on making it better: Have the keyholes all facing the same way? I don''t know if that would add to or take away though... hmmm tough to say really. Anyway, good luck and great shot! :) NVJC.', '2007-03-07 22:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3440840, 480481, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m distracted by the blur of the trees.  But I really like the contrasting colors.</td>', 'I''m distracted by the blur of the trees.  But I really like the contrasting colors.', '2007-03-07 22:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
