(3441267, 478686, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love this composition. Lovely cool blue effect.  Don''t know what this has to do with red....</td>', 'Love this composition. Lovely cool blue effect.  Don''t know what this has to do with red....', '2007-03-07 23:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
