(3441325, 478979, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice red, but I can''t seem to understand the very soft focus treatment.  Especially with the grain of the table wood so sharp.</td>', 'Nice red, but I can''t seem to understand the very soft focus treatment.  Especially with the grain of the table wood so sharp.', '2007-03-07 23:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3441340, 480084, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice curves and shades of red.  The red/blue contrast is so sharp you could cut yourself on it.</td>', 'Nice curves and shades of red.  The red/blue contrast is so sharp you could cut yourself on it.', '2007-03-07 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3441343, 478654, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice red.  I wonder if it would be stronger if you got rid of the busy bricks and just had snow as the background.  Or even a dog!  ;)</td>', 'Nice red.  I wonder if it would be stronger if you got rid of the busy bricks and just had snow as the background.  Or even a dog!  ;)', '2007-03-07 23:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
