(3441369, 479153, 16388, '<td valign="top">At the St.Pete Pier! I was down there on my bike today. Nice to find a local.</td>', 'At the St.Pete Pier! I was down there on my bike today. Nice to find a local.', '2007-03-07 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
