(3442298, 479153, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice stop motion.  The background is a bit disctracting and I''d score it higher if the whole bird was in the frame.  Jus a preference.  5.  J</td>', 'Nice stop motion.  The background is a bit disctracting and I''d score it higher if the whole bird was in the frame.  Jus a preference.  5.  J', '2007-03-08 07:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
