(3442303, 480074, 2716, '<td valign="top">I guess you''re going for the abstract feel in this shot.   It really does''t do anything for me.  It doesn''t raise "heat" in my mind.  Not an effective shot for ME.  4.  J</td>', 'I guess you''re going for the abstract feel in this shot.   It really does''t do anything for me.  It doesn''t raise "heat" in my mind.  Not an effective shot for ME.  4.  J', '2007-03-08 07:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3442305, 479080, 2716, '<td valign="top">aaaahhhahaha.  Great capture.  Dunno if this is your original idea but it''s great.  I''m sure you could have played with the lighting to make it less harsh / softer. 8 anyways.  J.</td>', 'aaaahhhahaha.  Great capture.  Dunno if this is your original idea but it''s great.  I''m sure you could have played with the lighting to make it less harsh / softer. 8 anyways.  J.', '2007-03-08 07:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3442308, 480276, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow I really like this idea.  The composition really works well.  The only thing that "bugs" me is that the lip stick looks like it got painted or something.  Still very effective.  9.  J</td>', 'Wow I really like this idea.  The composition really works well.  The only thing that "bugs" me is that the lip stick looks like it got painted or something.  Still very effective.  9.  J', '2007-03-08 07:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3442311, 480508, 2716, '<td valign="top">Hey, nice capture.  The only improvement I''d work on this type of shot is having more DOF in front of the flower ... not sure what cam you used, but it can be done by mannually focusing.  The DOF for the back is bang on.  J.  8</td>', 'Hey, nice capture.  The only improvement I''d work on this type of shot is having more DOF in front of the flower ... not sure what cam you used, but it can be done by mannually focusing.  The DOF for the back is bang on.  J.  8', '2007-03-08 08:01:28.000000', NULL, 1);
