(3442318, 480210, 2716, '<td valign="top">ooohhh what a great idea.  Unfortunately I find the executing is lacking in one major way: The lighting is the main problem in my eyes: the shadow on the back indicated a straight on flash, when a side light would be more flattering, ie. from a window, a lamp, or a strobe.  Thanks.  J.  6</td>', 'ooohhh what a great idea.  Unfortunately I find the executing is lacking in one major way: The lighting is the main problem in my eyes: the shadow on the back indicated a straight on flash, when a side light would be more flattering, ie. from a window, a lamp, or a strobe.  Thanks.  J.  6', '2007-03-08 08:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
