(3443312, 479961, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion and a strong composition.  Selective desat is used well here.  Well done!</td>', 'Great sense of motion and a strong composition.  Selective desat is used well here.  Well done!', '2007-03-08 13:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443322, 479681, 69102, '<td valign="top">this comes across as very unappetizing to me. not sure if it is the color of the chocolate (perhaps darker would have been better, the brown looks either like mud or rot) or if it is the lack of focus in the cut out area which makes the chocolate and the berry seem slimy. the not clean cut edge also doesn''t work. good idea, but for me it just doesn''t come across. - 5</td>', 'this comes across as very unappetizing to me. not sure if it is the color of the chocolate (perhaps darker would have been better, the brown looks either like mud or rot) or if it is the lack of focus in the cut out area which makes the chocolate and the berry seem slimy. the not clean cut edge also doesn''t work. good idea, but for me it just doesn''t come across. - 5', '2007-03-08 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443328, 478866, 42100, '<td valign="top">The disproportionate size of the head to the body makes the photo a bit uncomfortable, but it is still a cool POV, composition and photo.</td>', 'The disproportionate size of the head to the body makes the photo a bit uncomfortable, but it is still a cool POV, composition and photo.', '2007-03-08 13:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
