(3446182, 480182, 41116, '<td valign="top">There seem to be some harsh light on the top of the slice, maybe it is just me, but I like it, I think it adds to the image. - 8</td>', 'There seem to be some harsh light on the top of the slice, maybe it is just me, but I like it, I think it adds to the image. - 8', '2007-03-09 11:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
