(3447887, 480212, 70000, '<td valign="top">Precious! The straight on directness here really really works with the baby because the baby looks like its cooperating so niceley when you know a baby wouldn''t normally be such a great model. CUTE!</td>', 'Precious! The straight on directness here really really works with the baby because the baby looks like its cooperating so niceley when you know a baby wouldn''t normally be such a great model. CUTE!', '2007-03-10 00:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
