(3447992, 480497, 11467, '<td valign="top">More pinky purple.<br/>In photoshop you could use the hue saturation tool to make this more of a rich red.</td>', 'More pinky purple.In photoshop you could use the hue saturation tool to make this more of a rich red.', '2007-03-10 02:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
