(3448001, 480182, 11467, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot. I like the composition, and it is well executed. Just not red enough. 6</td>', 'Pretty nice shot. I like the composition, and it is well executed. Just not red enough. 6', '2007-03-10 02:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448006, 478463, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The light is perhaps a little bright and harsh. You need to soften it by using a light former, or reflecting off something.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The light is perhaps a little bright and harsh. You need to soften it by using a light former, or reflecting off something.', '2007-03-10 02:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448007, 478527, 11467, '<td valign="top">Even though this is a red challenge, doesn''t make red eye from a flash OK in my opinion.</td>', 'Even though this is a red challenge, doesn''t make red eye from a flash OK in my opinion.', '2007-03-10 02:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448010, 478785, 11467, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Makes you stop &amp; think... what''s going on here. Good capture</td>', 'I like this one. Makes you stop & think... what''s going on here. Good capture', '2007-03-10 02:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448012, 480490, 11467, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. I know that this sort of picture is NOT easy to get. Well done!</td>', 'Excellent photo. I know that this sort of picture is NOT easy to get. Well done!', '2007-03-10 02:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448013, 478139, 11467, '<td valign="top">Cute. The umbrella matches the boots too. Though I think it would score better in the red challenge if the umbrella was also red. Still, this is a great picture. 7</td>', 'Cute. The umbrella matches the boots too. Though I think it would score better in the red challenge if the umbrella was also red. Still, this is a great picture. 7', '2007-03-10 03:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448014, 479591, 11467, '<td valign="top">Errr, what is it? It is not abstract enough to be abstract, but cropped too much to know what it is.</td>', 'Errr, what is it? It is not abstract enough to be abstract, but cropped too much to know what it is.', '2007-03-10 03:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448017, 478004, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very Funny. Can''t say DNMC, but you are missing the rule of thirds</td>', 'Very Funny. Can''t say DNMC, but you are missing the rule of thirds', '2007-03-10 03:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448027, 478318, 11467, '<td valign="top">Love this photo. Will get hammered from all the prudes here. Well executed. 7</td>', 'Love this photo. Will get hammered from all the prudes here. Well executed. 7', '2007-03-10 03:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448085, 480019, 5746, '<td valign="top">The composition is great.I love the background pattern (perfectly chosen) and the subtle differences in shadows of red in this pictures. The green is very unusual yet natural - I''m glad you didin''t shift the hues (at least it looks like that). Perfect title. 10.</td>', 'The composition is great.I love the background pattern (perfectly chosen) and the subtle differences in shadows of red in this pictures. The green is very unusual yet natural - I''m glad you didin''t shift the hues (at least it looks like that). Perfect title. 10.', '2007-03-10 05:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448087, 480159, 5746, '<td valign="top">The splash of red is very small, yet it jumps out of the picture. Beatufiul landscape. The clarity of the picture is amazing and the water is 3 dimentional. Perfect composition, everything balanced and they way it supposed to be. Good luck with it. 10.</td>', 'The splash of red is very small, yet it jumps out of the picture. Beatufiul landscape. The clarity of the picture is amazing and the water is 3 dimentional. Perfect composition, everything balanced and they way it supposed to be. Good luck with it. 10.', '2007-03-10 05:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448088, 480241, 5746, '<td valign="top">Simple, but very creative. Detail is amazing. I like the composition and the colour scheme. 10.</td>', 'Simple, but very creative. Detail is amazing. I like the composition and the colour scheme. 10.', '2007-03-10 05:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448089, 480214, 5746, '<td valign="top">Perfect portrait. Her expression is great. 10.</td>', 'Perfect portrait. Her expression is great. 10.', '2007-03-10 05:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448090, 478867, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual angle here. The detail is great. The combination of shining red and silver steel is very appealing. 9.</td>', 'I like the unusual angle here. The detail is great. The combination of shining red and silver steel is very appealing. 9.', '2007-03-10 05:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448091, 478186, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very minimalistic. Beacuse there is no context it''s hard to say what size it is or where it is. It makes the picture even more interesting. Looks like a pice of modern art. I love it.</td>', 'Very minimalistic. Beacuse there is no context it''s hard to say what size it is or where it is. It makes the picture even more interesting. Looks like a pice of modern art. I love it.', '2007-03-10 05:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448092, 480278, 5746, '<td valign="top">So many interesting textures here. The detail is great. I love the composition. Very interesting effect. It could be a nice editorial picture. I especially like the fact that red is dsicreet and not so obvious. 9.</td>', 'So many interesting textures here. The detail is great. I love the composition. Very interesting effect. It could be a nice editorial picture. I especially like the fact that red is dsicreet and not so obvious. 9.', '2007-03-10 05:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448093, 480346, 5746, '<td valign="top">Red sunflower :) Great composition and detail. 8.</td>', 'Red sunflower :) Great composition and detail. 8.', '2007-03-10 05:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448095, 477802, 5746, '<td valign="top">I totally agree thet is has the graphic feel. I think it is overexposed a bit or maybe it was intentional? I like the detail of the interior. Very smooth car. 8.</td>', 'I totally agree thet is has the graphic feel. I think it is overexposed a bit or maybe it was intentional? I like the detail of the interior. Very smooth car. 8.', '2007-03-10 05:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448096, 479245, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great composition and beautiful model. I like that she''s not looking directly into camera. I like the contrast between cold and grey stones and warm, sot red coat. It looks like a pro fashion photo. 8.</td>', 'Great composition and beautiful model. I like that she''s not looking directly into camera. I like the contrast between cold and grey stones and warm, sot red coat. It looks like a pro fashion photo. 8.', '2007-03-10 05:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448097, 479903, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I like the composition. The sign on the left balance the picture perfectly. 8.</td>', 'Great capture. I like the composition. The sign on the left balance the picture perfectly. 8.', '2007-03-10 05:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
