(3448228, 480017, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a nice feel to it in general.  The position of the golfer in your composition works well as does capturing his swing and the ball in flight.  For me, I kind of expect to see a nice sculptured golf course background area, instead it''s scruffy and a non-player in the overall image.  Hope I''m explaining that correctly...golfer good, golf course background blah.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This has a nice feel to it in general.  The position of the golfer in your composition works well as does capturing his swing and the ball in flight.  For me, I kind of expect to see a nice sculptured golf course background area, instead it''s scruffy and a non-player in the overall image.  Hope I''m explaining that correctly...golfer good, golf course background blah.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-03-10 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3448240, 479627, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, some red in here alright.  :D  While your heart is in the right place, I think this is going to suffer in scoring because of the subject matter (stuffed toy).  On the technical side, the lighting is a little harsh.  Try and use some diffused (bounced lighting) rather than depending totally on flash.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yep, some red in here alright.  :D  While your heart is in the right place, I think this is going to suffer in scoring because of the subject matter (stuffed toy).  On the technical side, the lighting is a little harsh.  Try and use some diffused (bounced lighting) rather than depending totally on flash.  Good luck.', '2007-03-10 08:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
