(3448329, 479025, 67258, '<td valign="top">There are things about this that I really like, but also bits that I dislike:<br/>Pros:  The shadow of the tree that almost perfectly matches up with the real tree is amazing, and really well spotted.  The composition is sound, and I particular like the inclusion of the tank(?) in the background, which helps to provide depth.<br/>Cons:  Over-saturated for my taste, and also (I think) over-sharpened - the branches and twigs are somehow ''wrong''.</td>', 'There are things about this that I really like, but also bits that I dislike:Pros:  The shadow of the tree that almost perfectly matches up with the real tree is amazing, and really well spotted.  The composition is sound, and I particular like the inclusion of the tank(?) in the background, which helps to provide depth.Cons:  Over-saturated for my taste, and also (I think) over-sharpened - the branches and twigs are somehow ''wrong''.', '2007-03-10 09:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
