(3449353, 479734, 51793, '<td valign="top">It''s a little hard to see the peanut M&amp;M''s but after reading the title I was actually looking for them. Then I noticed that it looks like you have them sitting on your leg or a pair of jeans or something. You should have set them on something red or put them in a bowl and added a bunch of them. Lighting is slightly off but I''m giving a good score because it''s not something that everyone thought of and I like the idea of it. Like me, work on lighting and plan out what you actually want from the picture. I know I have a hard time doing all this too but once I look at someone elses I can actually see the pros and cons.</td>', 'It''s a little hard to see the peanut M&M''s but after reading the title I was actually looking for them. Then I noticed that it looks like you have them sitting on your leg or a pair of jeans or something. You should have set them on something red or put them in a bowl and added a bunch of them. Lighting is slightly off but I''m giving a good score because it''s not something that everyone thought of and I like the idea of it. Like me, work on lighting and plan out what you actually want from the picture. I know I have a hard time doing all this too but once I look at someone elses I can actually see the pros and cons.', '2007-03-10 19:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
