(3449641, 480105, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice and crisp.  Certainly ''Red''.  :D  Something about the water droplets is throwing me off on this.  Maybe it''s the pure white lighting?  Makes it look a little unnatural and studio(ish), rather than warm lighting you''d get from natural sunlight.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is nice and crisp.  Certainly ''Red''.  :D  Something about the water droplets is throwing me off on this.  Maybe it''s the pure white lighting?  Makes it look a little unnatural and studio(ish), rather than warm lighting you''d get from natural sunlight.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-10 22:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
