(3450462, 478455, 30049, '<td valign="top">You mean like this? <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=389903" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/548/thumb/389903.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/548/thumb/389903.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/548/thumb/389903.jpg"/></a>  :D<br/> <br/>I like the way you''ve composed this positioning the center of the flower on the lower left ROT point.  Crisp and well focused overall.  Lighting glare on the wet paint is a little distracting, but not major.  Biggest complaint I have is the handle of the brush.  It just jumps right out there and tries to steal the show, if you know what I mean.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You mean like this?   :D I like the way you''ve composed this positioning the center of the flower on the lower left ROT point.  Crisp and well focused overall.  Lighting glare on the wet paint is a little distracting, but not major.  Biggest complaint I have is the handle of the brush.  It just jumps right out there and tries to steal the show, if you know what I mean.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-11 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450466, 479436, 30049, '<td valign="top">A very nice abstract.  Good use of DOF to add interest.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very nice abstract.  Good use of DOF to add interest.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-11 14:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450470, 479222, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and it''s very well focused (maybe a little oversharpened).  Very well balanced lighting also.  Couple of things distracting for me are the positioning of her hand (seems very posed and unnatural) and the fingernails could be neater (??? sorry, not a manicurist - don''t know the term, just see it as a distraction).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition, and it''s very well focused (maybe a little oversharpened).  Very well balanced lighting also.  Couple of things distracting for me are the positioning of her hand (seems very posed and unnatural) and the fingernails could be neater (??? sorry, not a manicurist - don''t know the term, just see it as a distraction).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-11 14:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450471, 479891, 30049, '<td valign="top">Just a tad on the gross side.  Not very appealing.  Ok for Halloween I guess, just seems out of place here.  Sorry.  Good luck.<br/> <br/>Ok.  Here''s an update.  I''m sitting here with my 5 year-old son and he''s like "Dad - I like the skeleton one".  Thought I''d share that with you.  :D</td>', 'Just a tad on the gross side.  Not very appealing.  Ok for Halloween I guess, just seems out of place here.  Sorry.  Good luck. Ok.  Here''s an update.  I''m sitting here with my 5 year-old son and he''s like "Dad - I like the skeleton one".  Thought I''d share that with you.  :D', '2007-03-11 14:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450473, 480369, 30049, '<td valign="top">Overall, it''s "ok" IMO.  The light fades out a little too much for me in the back left.  Nice use of DOF to highlight the red crayon.  Now for the rest of the story...<br/> <br/>I''m sitting here with my 5 year-old son looking at some challenge thumbs, and he says "Dad, I like the crayon one".  I ask him what he likes about it.  He thinks the crayons are moving, or rolling away from the red one.  Funny, I wouldn''t have thought that myself at first glance, but now that he mentions it I can kind of see it.  :D  Just thought I''d share that with you.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Overall, it''s "ok" IMO.  The light fades out a little too much for me in the back left.  Nice use of DOF to highlight the red crayon.  Now for the rest of the story... I''m sitting here with my 5 year-old son looking at some challenge thumbs, and he says "Dad, I like the crayon one".  I ask him what he likes about it.  He thinks the crayons are moving, or rolling away from the red one.  Funny, I wouldn''t have thought that myself at first glance, but now that he mentions it I can kind of see it.  :D  Just thought I''d share that with you. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-11 14:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450475, 476956, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the image, the leading lines into the distance, the vibrant colors, and the composition.  Sky is a little pale, but tricky to fix in a basic challenge - best to apply a filter at time of capture (polarizer, split ND, etc...).  Biggest drawback for me is the amount of ''Red'', in the context of the challenge theme.  JMO of course.  Really, a wonderful image in most other aspects.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the image, the leading lines into the distance, the vibrant colors, and the composition.  Sky is a little pale, but tricky to fix in a basic challenge - best to apply a filter at time of capture (polarizer, split ND, etc...).  Biggest drawback for me is the amount of ''Red'', in the context of the challenge theme.  JMO of course.  Really, a wonderful image in most other aspects.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-11 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
