(3451358, 478463, 29513, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh for my taste.  I do like the dynamic range of the background. and the pose.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh for my taste.  I do like the dynamic range of the background. and the pose.', '2007-03-11 22:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451364, 479326, 46598, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous studio photography. I just wish your glass table was clean and that the liquid was actually red and not orange looking.</td>', 'Gorgeous studio photography. I just wish your glass table was clean and that the liquid was actually red and not orange looking.', '2007-03-11 22:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451372, 479971, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but I don''t like the extreme color-shift. Those bright purple waves just don''t work for me.</td>', 'Good composition, but I don''t like the extreme color-shift. Those bright purple waves just don''t work for me.', '2007-03-11 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451376, 480540, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the frame is far too intrusive for me</td>', 'Great idea, but the frame is far too intrusive for me', '2007-03-11 22:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451379, 480200, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the dark background.  Really sets off the coloring of the model.  I like the lighting.  Very mysterious.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice use of the dark background.  Really sets off the coloring of the model.  I like the lighting.  Very mysterious.  Well done.', '2007-03-11 22:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451386, 480256, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Some different choices of background colors might have made a big difference, though.  Something that contrasts more with the model''s hair and skin.  You also might try framing her offset to the right on the rule-of-thirds line, say.  Nice expression and nice pose.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Some different choices of background colors might have made a big difference, though.  Something that contrasts more with the model''s hair and skin.  You also might try framing her offset to the right on the rule-of-thirds line, say.  Nice expression and nice pose.', '2007-03-11 22:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451393, 480481, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color and selective sharpness (did you blur the background or is that natural? Either way it looks great!). But a bit too much foreground, I''d sacrifice the two geese in the lower left corner and crop just below the third one. Or get radical and loose them all and go for the panoramic look, since the hanger and background works all by itself.</td>', 'Excellent use of color and selective sharpness (did you blur the background or is that natural? Either way it looks great!). But a bit too much foreground, I''d sacrifice the two geese in the lower left corner and crop just below the third one. Or get radical and loose them all and go for the panoramic look, since the hanger and background works all by itself.', '2007-03-11 22:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451395, 480034, 42495, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and I like the light. The top of the picture is a bit distracting, would have been better if solid throughout.</td>', 'Clever idea and I like the light. The top of the picture is a bit distracting, would have been better if solid throughout.', '2007-03-11 22:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451397, 480281, 42495, '<td valign="top">The red just pops off the screen.  One of the best I''ve seen yet.</td>', 'The red just pops off the screen.  One of the best I''ve seen yet.', '2007-03-11 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451400, 480292, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very well captured, but I''d loose the frame</td>', 'Very well captured, but I''d loose the frame', '2007-03-11 22:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451401, 480052, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good idea but there''s something about the crop I don''t like. Perhaps just a bit too much negative space.</td>', 'Good idea but there''s something about the crop I don''t like. Perhaps just a bit too much negative space.', '2007-03-11 22:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451405, 477168, 63206, '<td valign="top">I like the reds in the trees, but your sister isn''t too clear. Maybe if you could see her face, or a little more of the action.  Is she running through the leaves?  It''s hard to tell.  Maybe if you''d shot her from the side, as she was running through.</td>', 'I like the reds in the trees, but your sister isn''t too clear. Maybe if you could see her face, or a little more of the action.  Is she running through the leaves?  It''s hard to tell.  Maybe if you''d shot her from the side, as she was running through.', '2007-03-11 22:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451406, 480159, 7485, '<td valign="top">Thingvellir? <i>Great</i> idea, but the bright pink sky in the upper left just plain looks wrong. Also the halos around the water''s edge and the cliff on the right are too obvious. HDR gone wrong?</td>', 'Thingvellir? Great idea, but the bright pink sky in the upper left just plain looks wrong. Also the halos around the water''s edge and the cliff on the right are too obvious. HDR gone wrong?', '2007-03-11 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451422, 479253, 46598, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Would like to see the image flipped and the other "girouette" (can''t remember the English name!!) deleted/framed out... but all and all love the colours, the deepness of the red and the sharpness. Nice work!!</td>', 'Nice shot. Would like to see the image flipped and the other "girouette" (can''t remember the English name!!) deleted/framed out... but all and all love the colours, the deepness of the red and the sharpness. Nice work!!', '2007-03-11 23:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451434, 480094, 7485, '<td valign="top">If you crop the sliver of windows at the left then you have great photo! Just try sliding it over on your screen, it''s so much simpler and more effective that way. 7 (would have been a 10 with the crop)</td>', 'If you crop the sliver of windows at the left then you have great photo! Just try sliding it over on your screen, it''s so much simpler and more effective that way. 7 (would have been a 10 with the crop)', '2007-03-11 23:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
