(3455495, 478674, 32968, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast you''ve made with the two colors of apples. The red stands out from the rest. They look cold and crispy too! Great macro shot in there with those tiny droplets of moisture, as well. 8</td>', 'I like the contrast you''ve made with the two colors of apples. The red stands out from the rest. They look cold and crispy too! Great macro shot in there with those tiny droplets of moisture, as well. 8', '2007-03-13 02:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3455505, 480506, 32968, '<td valign="top">Bit more cropping needed to balance this. Otherwise it''s a cool catch. 7</td>', 'Bit more cropping needed to balance this. Otherwise it''s a cool catch. 7', '2007-03-13 03:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3455510, 478473, 32968, '<td valign="top">Great shot but a bit off center (or not quite enuf off center?) 7</td>', 'Great shot but a bit off center (or not quite enuf off center?) 7', '2007-03-13 03:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3455514, 480256, 11467, '<td valign="top">You have to use better lighting for images like this.<br/>Don''t use the on camera flash.<br/>Experimenting with cheap Gloodlights from hardware stores can create astoundingly good pictures. Get the light to the side &amp; soften it by shooting through some sort of difuser.<br/>Beautiful model by the way.</td>', 'You have to use better lighting for images like this.Don''t use the on camera flash.Experimenting with cheap Gloodlights from hardware stores can create astoundingly good pictures. Get the light to the side & soften it by shooting through some sort of difuser.Beautiful model by the way.', '2007-03-13 03:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3455515, 479837, 32968, '<td valign="top">Needs a straighten but this is a cool shot. Too many vertical lines to get away with any crookedness! 5</td>', 'Needs a straighten but this is a cool shot. Too many vertical lines to get away with any crookedness! 5', '2007-03-13 03:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
