(3456805, 479725, 42100, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little flat and undramatic, but the pose and composition are very good.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The lighting seems a little flat and undramatic, but the pose and composition are very good.  Nicely done!', '2007-03-13 15:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456806, 480200, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice drama from the light and composition.  Great clarity as well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice drama from the light and composition.  Great clarity as well.  Nicely done!', '2007-03-13 15:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456808, 480066, 42100, '<td valign="top">A very nice clean photo with an interesting story in it.  The red is probably understated for a challenge that may be dominated by photos with much more bold red themes.</td>', 'A very nice clean photo with an interesting story in it.  The red is probably understated for a challenge that may be dominated by photos with much more bold red themes.', '2007-03-13 15:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456813, 480170, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very good macro, the detail is really crisp.</td>', 'Very good macro, the detail is really crisp.', '2007-03-13 15:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456815, 480518, 42100, '<td valign="top">I really like this concept, colors are bold and detail is very good.  However, the vase is a very powerful element and steals some of the glory from the roses.</td>', 'I really like this concept, colors are bold and detail is very good.  However, the vase is a very powerful element and steals some of the glory from the roses.', '2007-03-13 15:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456816, 478202, 42100, '<td valign="top">I really like the starkness asnd boldness of the colors of this photo.  The composition feels a bit unsettled and keeps from really pushing this over the top.</td>', 'I really like the starkness asnd boldness of the colors of this photo.  The composition feels a bit unsettled and keeps from really pushing this over the top.', '2007-03-13 15:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456818, 480157, 42100, '<td valign="top">Cool angle and composition.  Dramatic color tone and exposure.  Very nice!</td>', 'Cool angle and composition.  Dramatic color tone and exposure.  Very nice!', '2007-03-13 15:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456822, 478675, 42100, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy...very fuzzy looking.  Really like the color tones, not as big a fan of the cropping though...mainly just the beak part seems to bug me.</td>', 'Cute little guy...very fuzzy looking.  Really like the color tones, not as big a fan of the cropping though...mainly just the beak part seems to bug me.', '2007-03-13 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456829, 477853, 42100, '<td valign="top">The technicals are all great here, the sharpness, color clarity and use of shallow DOF.  Creatively though its a bit on the mundane side.</td>', 'The technicals are all great here, the sharpness, color clarity and use of shallow DOF.  Creatively though its a bit on the mundane side.', '2007-03-13 15:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456841, 478686, 74747, '<td valign="top">I like the photo very much but how does it apply to the challenge?</td>', 'I like the photo very much but how does it apply to the challenge?', '2007-03-13 15:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456846, 478512, 74747, '<td valign="top">Pretty scenery for a pretty car!</td>', 'Pretty scenery for a pretty car!', '2007-03-13 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456850, 479559, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great color and clarity, composition is very good as well.  Red &amp; blue usually make a great combo, but for this photo I really wish the blue wasn''t there.  I know, kind of a petty nitpick...it doesn''t kill what is a really good photo, but just kind of jumps out at me.</td>', 'Great color and clarity, composition is very good as well.  Red & blue usually make a great combo, but for this photo I really wish the blue wasn''t there.  I know, kind of a petty nitpick...it doesn''t kill what is a really good photo, but just kind of jumps out at me.', '2007-03-13 15:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456861, 479368, 42100, '<td valign="top">The color tones are very rich and complimentary to the reds of the subjects.  Composition is very good as well.  Nicely done!<br/> <br/>Hmmm...wonder whose photo this coud be!  ;)</td>', 'The color tones are very rich and complimentary to the reds of the subjects.  Composition is very good as well.  Nicely done! Hmmm...wonder whose photo this coud be!  ;)', '2007-03-13 15:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456862, 480039, 42100, '<td valign="top">Cool subject...composition and light are great.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Cool subject...composition and light are great.  Nicely done!', '2007-03-13 15:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456868, 479117, 42100, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I''m not sure if it was your creative intention or not, but I the highlights seem too bright.  Other than that it looks great...nicely done!</td>', 'LOL!  I''m not sure if it was your creative intention or not, but I the highlights seem too bright.  Other than that it looks great...nicely done!', '2007-03-13 15:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3456877, 480490, 42100, '<td valign="top">Excellent technicals!  I can''t quite tell if the middle one is trying to act annoyed by the joker, or just plain ready to bust a gut over the way the joker looks.  Funny stuff!</td>', 'Excellent technicals!  I can''t quite tell if the middle one is trying to act annoyed by the joker, or just plain ready to bust a gut over the way the joker looks.  Funny stuff!', '2007-03-13 15:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
