(3457400, 479079, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I am not voting, but I''m leaving comments on the images that move me for whatever reason.  Effective use of light, great exposure control, and significant emotive impact.  Not sure about the red duotone being actually "red" in the challenge sense of the word, but I''m not voting anyway so it''s neither here nor there.  Great image.  Congrats!  :)</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I am not voting, but I''m leaving comments on the images that move me for whatever reason.  Effective use of light, great exposure control, and significant emotive impact.  Not sure about the red duotone being actually "red" in the challenge sense of the word, but I''m not voting anyway so it''s neither here nor there.  Great image.  Congrats!  :)', '2007-03-13 20:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3457402, 479117, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very creative and fun.  Love the humor and the visual impact.  Well done!</td>', 'Very creative and fun.  Love the humor and the visual impact.  Well done!', '2007-03-13 20:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
