(3457425, 478318, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely model and effective pose. Her skin appears to be very edited and oversmoothed, especially in the torso and on her backside.    Though she is a thin model, the pose makes her tummy muscles pooch out a little and it''s a bit unflattering, along with the wrinkles around the midsection.  I''d think that if  you go so far as to edit to smooth her skin, you might go a little further and smooth out the tummy area too.  Excellent focus on her face and her shoes.  Great touch of red.  Anyway, since this was a basic editing challenge, I''m assuming it''s been validated at this point.</td>', 'Lovely model and effective pose. Her skin appears to be very edited and oversmoothed, especially in the torso and on her backside.    Though she is a thin model, the pose makes her tummy muscles pooch out a little and it''s a bit unflattering, along with the wrinkles around the midsection.  I''d think that if  you go so far as to edit to smooth her skin, you might go a little further and smooth out the tummy area too.  Excellent focus on her face and her shoes.  Great touch of red.  Anyway, since this was a basic editing challenge, I''m assuming it''s been validated at this point.', '2007-03-13 20:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
