(3457821, 479326, 29011, '<td valign="top">Excellent splash. One of my ideas if I where to find the time to shoot for the challenge and very glad to see such a nicely executed shot! Really great work here. The liquid is on the tip of being more orange than red. Yes orange is a red hue ;) but I think it would''ve been even more of a killer shot if a slight saturation/hue adjustment was made to make this really red. Still, it''s a fave of this challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent splash. One of my ideas if I where to find the time to shoot for the challenge and very glad to see such a nicely executed shot! Really great work here. The liquid is on the tip of being more orange than red. Yes orange is a red hue ;) but I think it would''ve been even more of a killer shot if a slight saturation/hue adjustment was made to make this really red. Still, it''s a fave of this challenge. Good luck.', '2007-03-13 23:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
