(3458679, 478527, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aKiwi:</b></div><hr/><i> Even though this is a red challenge, doesn''t make red eye from a flash OK in my opinion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Obviously, the red eye effect is a sign of bad taste, and the tendency of these devil creatures to expose themselves to mortals in such a way is no excuse.</td>', 'Originally posted by aKiwi: Even though this is a red challenge, doesn''t make red eye from a flash OK in my opinion.   Obviously, the red eye effect is a sign of bad taste, and the tendency of these devil creatures to expose themselves to mortals in such a way is no excuse.', '2007-03-14 04:26:35.000000', NULL, 0),
