(3459365, 480273, 23484, '<td valign="top">I hate to burst everyone''s bubble but those aren''t cherrys. They''re crabapples.  I was going to take a bunch of shots that day but it was so cold and the wind was blowing so hard that after 4 shots I''d had enough.</td>', 'I hate to burst everyone''s bubble but those aren''t cherrys. They''re crabapples.  I was going to take a bunch of shots that day but it was so cold and the wind was blowing so hard that after 4 shots I''d had enough.', '2007-03-14 08:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459425, 480276, 29293, '<td valign="top">awesome color and lighting</td>', 'awesome color and lighting', '2007-03-14 08:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
