(3459634, 478463, 58728, '<td valign="top">WOW. I guess I''m not surprised about the majority of comments, but I totally find the contrast and harsh lighting to work REALLY well.  It''s different.  It''s fun.  The lighting gives a fashion/editorial feel.  I can see this is a magazine.  I really love what you did with it. I had given it a 10.</td>', 'WOW. I guess I''m not surprised about the majority of comments, but I totally find the contrast and harsh lighting to work REALLY well.  It''s different.  It''s fun.  The lighting gives a fashion/editorial feel.  I can see this is a magazine.  I really love what you did with it. I had given it a 10.', '2007-03-14 09:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459680, 479906, 68256, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 when voting and it is on my first page.  I''m guessing the only reason it didn''t score better is because you didn''t use the full 640 width?  It is a great concept, well lit and well composed.  I''m shocked it didn''t score better.  There must be a lot of sub 5s given for smaller photos no matter how well they are done?</td>', 'I gave this a 9 when voting and it is on my first page.  I''m guessing the only reason it didn''t score better is because you didn''t use the full 640 width?  It is a great concept, well lit and well composed.  I''m shocked it didn''t score better.  There must be a lot of sub 5s given for smaller photos no matter how well they are done?', '2007-03-14 09:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
