(3459794, 477472, 73884, '<td valign="top">I''m dissapointed on how ideas vs. mot-a-mot challenge interpretations are punished on DPC. At least a quarter of the pics in the Red challenge are quite uninspired (to put it midly) and badly executed. Yet, they get a better score than this one! David, you should''ve put a tomato on the table an take a snapshot at it, you would''ve been in the top 50%!</td>', 'I''m dissapointed on how ideas vs. mot-a-mot challenge interpretations are punished on DPC. At least a quarter of the pics in the Red challenge are quite uninspired (to put it midly) and badly executed. Yet, they get a better score than this one! David, you should''ve put a tomato on the table an take a snapshot at it, you would''ve been in the top 50%!', '2007-03-14 10:20:36.000000', NULL, 0),
