(3459963, 480194, 59697, '<td valign="top">I like how the panel is divided into 4 sections, and three of them have slits or holes while the fourth one doesn''t. It keeps my eye moving around the photo and there isn''t much blank space. My only comment would be to either boost the saturation or desaturate it more, the color of it now is kind of in-between. Well done.</td>', 'I like how the panel is divided into 4 sections, and three of them have slits or holes while the fourth one doesn''t. It keeps my eye moving around the photo and there isn''t much blank space. My only comment would be to either boost the saturation or desaturate it more, the color of it now is kind of in-between. Well done.', '2007-03-14 11:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3460129, 480273, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  They really do look  like ice-glazed cherries!!  Their color is perfect.  You''ve almost got a natural vignette going in the background.  I like the composition here, but fyi dpc will knee-jerkedly give you a higher score if you crop the right so that the focussed cherries lie near a third line. Actually, this might be interesting with a square crop. I''m glad you braved the cold to get this!  Hurry Spring!</td>', 'This is beautiful!  They really do look  like ice-glazed cherries!!  Their color is perfect.  You''ve almost got a natural vignette going in the background.  I like the composition here, but fyi dpc will knee-jerkedly give you a higher score if you crop the right so that the focussed cherries lie near a third line. Actually, this might be interesting with a square crop. I''m glad you braved the cold to get this!  Hurry Spring!', '2007-03-14 11:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
