(3462206, 480273, 56880, '<td valign="top">The focus is sharp on the foreground cherries, and their stems, but I think their shape could have been brought out more if there was a light source on, say, the left side of you, though not perpendicular to your view.  You could get a catch-light effect on each of the cherries then.<br/> <br/>Edit: Sheesh, look like I got for writing comments before reading other ones..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-14 20:38:50.</i></td>', 'The focus is sharp on the foreground cherries, and their stems, but I think their shape could have been brought out more if there was a light source on, say, the left side of you, though not perpendicular to your view.  You could get a catch-light effect on each of the cherries then. Edit: Sheesh, look like I got for writing comments before reading other ones..', '2007-03-14 20:38:14.000000', '2007-03-14 20:38:50.000000', 0),
