(3466477, 479684, 68586, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jimbo2277:</b></div><hr/><i> Amazing clarity, beautiful shot. But some slight yellow reflection in the bottom right spoils it from being 100% perfect. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Jim, Sadly this was a ''Basic Editing'' challenge, so I couldn''t lose the reflection.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the kind words though  :- )</td>', 'Originally posted by jimbo2277: Amazing clarity, beautiful shot. But some slight yellow reflection in the bottom right spoils it from being 100% perfect.   Jim, Sadly this was a ''Basic Editing'' challenge, so I couldn''t lose the reflection. Thanks for the kind words though  :- )', '2007-03-16 12:34:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3466704, 478530, 56880, '<td valign="top">I think a deeper DOF would help this; the string blurring at the edge of the spool distracts me from the detail that is in focus.</td>', 'I think a deeper DOF would help this; the string blurring at the edge of the spool distracts me from the detail that is in focus.', '2007-03-16 15:17:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3466712, 477607, 56880, '<td valign="top">This looks cluttered, as the lines made by the sewing needles, the spiral thing, and the pen, all lead away from the image.  It also looks a little flat.  Given those materials, I might have made a nest with the ribbon and that other ribbon-looking thing in the upper left, placed the smaller items inside, and took a shot "peeking in".</td>', 'This looks cluttered, as the lines made by the sewing needles, the spiral thing, and the pen, all lead away from the image.  It also looks a little flat.  Given those materials, I might have made a nest with the ribbon and that other ribbon-looking thing in the upper left, placed the smaller items inside, and took a shot "peeking in".', '2007-03-16 15:20:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3466714, 479736, 56880, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the triangle formed by the tree trunk, barn roof, and flag pole.  All of the small branches in front form a kind of noise; the subject (to me) is the barn.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the triangle formed by the tree trunk, barn roof, and flag pole.  All of the small branches in front form a kind of noise; the subject (to me) is the barn.', '2007-03-16 15:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
