(3468996, 480276, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed.  Love the angle and the simple white &amp; red.  I think this border works very well with the shot too.  I voted 7.</td>', 'Very nicely composed.  Love the angle and the simple white & red.  I think this border works very well with the shot too.  I voted 7.', '2007-03-17 19:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3469003, 480285, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed shot and the border works well too.  These buggers are hard to shoot!  The thing that would have greatly improved your score would have been lighting...something you had no control over outside!  Yup...6 from me!  : )</td>', 'Very nicely composed shot and the border works well too.  These buggers are hard to shoot!  The thing that would have greatly improved your score would have been lighting...something you had no control over outside!  Yup...6 from me!  : )', '2007-03-17 19:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
