(3469441, 479368, 54944, '<td valign="top">i like this one a lot, it should have scored higher. The depth that winding road in the back gives it is a really nice touch.</td>', 'i like this one a lot, it should have scored higher. The depth that winding road in the back gives it is a really nice touch.', '2007-03-18 04:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
